# MODAL-01 — Use semantic dialog

## Rationale

Native `<dialog>` or `role="dialog"` + `aria-modal="true"` gives correct semantics.

## How to check

```bash
bun "<skill-dir>/scripts/cli.ts" check modals-dialogs <file>
```

## How to fix

Propose converting to `<dialog>` or adding the roles.
